      ],
      "content": "GREAT GADDESDEN        DODDS LANE TL 01 SE                                         (South side) 4/77 -                                       Barn at Little                                         Lovetts End Farm                                         to East of house GV                                        II Barn. Later C17. Timber frame on low brick sill, dark weatherboarded with steep-pitched roof now gap-slated. A 4 bays barn facing S with swept roof to projecting porch in 2nd bay from E and winnowing door to rear. Bull-nose jowled posts with straight braces to tie-beams. Single purlin to each slope of clasped-purlin roof with inclined straight queen-posts (no collars). Long curved wind braces to purlin from each gable end. Mid-height rail tenoned in-line in walls and at higher level in  gable  walls.  Numbered  joints.  Squint-butted  scarf  joints  in wallplates and purlins. Listing NGR: TL0633410253"
    }
  ],
